 "description": "AI research brief on any topic from the last 1-30 days: gathers Hacker News, Reddit and worldwide news (GDELT), then writes a concise briefing (key developments, sentiment, what to watch) with numbered citations to the sources, plus the full item list. Built for research agents. Price: $0.03 in USDC per call (x402 or prepaid credits). Paid only (not in the free trial).",
